@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@gwUrl = http://localhost:5081

### Lesson 10: inspect Catalog menu for Tadka Indiranagar (restaurant 7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/catalog/restaurants/7/menu

### Lesson 10: place item-based order using ICatalogModule price quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checkout-demo-1

{"customerId":51,"restaurantId":7,"items":[{"menuItemId":101,"quantity":2}]}

### Lesson 11: checkout through API Gateway (:5081) with correlation ID
POST {{gwUrl}}/api/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tadka-Client: mobile-app
X-Correlation-Id: trace-gw-101
Idempotency-Key: gw-demo-1

{"customerId":51,"restaurantId":7,"items":[{"menuItemId":101,"quantity":1}]}

### Lesson 11: mobile client blocked from operator status update (403)
PATCH {{gwUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tadka-Client: mobile-app

{"status":"preparing"}

### Lesson 11: partner-web allowed to mutate status (200)
PATCH {{gwUrl}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tadka-Client: partner-web

{"status":"preparing"}

### Lesson 11: internal diagnostic route blocked at gateway (403)
GET {{gwUrl}}/api/orders/1/naive-join-receipt
X-Tadka-Client: partner-web

### Lesson 11: mobile BFF compact tracking payload
GET {{gwUrl}}/bff/mobile/orders/1/tracking
X-Tadka-Client: mobile-app

### Lesson 11 negative control: strict mode returns 502 when Catalog fails
GET {{gwUrl}}/bff/mobile/orders/1/tracking?mode=strict
X-Tadka-Client: mobile-app
X-Demo-Catalog-Failure: true

### Lesson 11 resilient BFF: returns 200 with catalogDegraded=true when Catalog fails
GET {{gwUrl}}/bff/mobile/orders/1/tracking
X-Tadka-Client: mobile-app
X-Demo-Catalog-Failure: true

### Lesson 11: partner BFF full itemized view
GET {{gwUrl}}/bff/partner/orders/1
X-Tadka-Client: partner-web
